"""Brazilian Portuguese UI translations.

Keys are the exact English source strings used as the ``tr("...")``
argument throughout ``commander_gui/ui/*.py``. Proper nouns/brand terms
(GAMMA, STALKER, Anomaly, COMMANDER, Mod Organizer 2/MO2, Winetricks,
Proton/GE-Proton, FOMOD, Nexus, specific mod/repo names, filenames such as
settings.json/modlist.txt, environment variables) are kept untranslated,
matching standard localization practice. Format placeholders (``{name}``,
``{path}``, ``{exc}``, ...) are preserved exactly.
"""

